# Local working directories, never for publication. /screenshots/ in particular
# holds the RAW captures taken straight off the phone, before the pass that
# removes the account name and other personal details — the scrubbed set that
# ships lives in docs/screenshots/ (tracked) and playstore/ assets. Leading
# slashes keep these root-only so docs/screenshots/ is unaffected.
/screenshots/
/output/
.claude/
